@startuml
title Door
[*] --> Closed
state Closed : the latch is down
state Open
state Locked {
  [*] --> Bolted
  Bolted --> Alarmed : force
  Alarmed --> [H] : reset
}
state check <<choice>>
Closed --> Open : open
Open --> Closed : close
Closed --> check : lock
check --> Locked : [key]
check --> Closed : [no key]
Locked --> Closed : unlock
note right of Open : no draft
Open --> [*]
@enduml
